WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.192
Summaries retain the central point and essential supporting events, not every minor

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:06.856
detail or repeated phrase.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.385
What comes first when preparing a summary? Answer: Read the whole text for its

00:00:12.385 --> 00:00:13.055
central idea.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:18.325
Summarise a text orally, then write a five-sentence version in your own words.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.440
Why it works: The gist guides selection.
